//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
// f32 `powf`, ported from LLVM libc into `core::libm`, against LLVM libc itself. For each pair
// (x, y), given by their bits, this prints the bits of `x.powf(y)` (a NaN as 2143289344), then
// a hash of 2^20 more pairs: x of either sign with an exponent from -30 to 30, and y either a
// whole number from -30 to 30 or of either sign and below 8 in size (a negative x with such a
// y gives NaN). The expected line is what LLVM libc at f475f085bf7b prints, built with FMA.
// The pairs are:
// - two found by searching 2.4 billion pairs for inputs whose fast result is wrong, so that the
//   accurate pass decides them, each with both signs of y;
// - three whole powers that are exact in f32 but come out one unit off without the exact loop
//   for small whole y;
// - every pair of zeros, ones, twos, ten, a half, infinities, quiet and signaling NaNs, a
//   subnormal, large values and the largest float;
// - 300 random pairs like those in the hash.
// The port also matched LLVM libc on 2^30 pairs of each kind.
//
// EXPECT: 1070208985 1059202206 1078685109 1050743844 2885779840 3011808654 3238301070 1065353216 1065353216 0 2139095040 0 2139095040 0 0 2139095040 0 0 2139095040 0 0 0 2139095040 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 2147483648 4286578688 0 2139095040 0 0 2139095040 2147483648 0 2139095040 0 0 0 2139095040 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 3212836864 3212836864 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 2143289344 2143289344 3212836864 1065353216 1065353216 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 1065353216 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 1073741824 1056964608 1082130432 1048576000 1149239296 1068827891 1043662067 1090519040 2139095040 0 1065353216 2139095040 2139095040 0 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 3221225472 3204448256 1082130432 1048576000 1149239296 2143289344 2143289344 3238002688 2139095040 0 2143289344 2139095040 2139095040 0 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 1092616192 1036831949 1120403456 1008981770 1343554297 1078616770 995049015 1148846080 2139095040 0 1065353216 2139095040 2139095040 0 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 1056964608 1073741824 1048576000 1082130432 981467136 1060439283 1085605107 1040187392 0 2139095040 1065353216 0 0 2139095040 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 3223322624 3201092813 1086849024 1042536202 1175782137 2143289344 2143289344 3245998080 2139095040 0 2143289344 2139095040 2139095040 0 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 1077936128 1051372203 1091567616 1038323257 1197910272 1071494103 1032020247 1104674816 2139095040 0 1065353216 2139095040 2139095040 0 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 2139095040 0 2139095040 0 2139095040 2139095040 0 2139095040 2139095040 0 2139095040 2139095040 2139095040 0 2143289344 2143289344 1065353216 1065353216 4286578688 214748364